      "factual_description": "Billboard Live Tokyo presents Maki Ohguro Album '55 RED' Release Commemorative Live Vol.1 on Thursday, November 12, 2026, with stages at 5:30 PM and 8:30 PM. Billboard lists Maki Ohguro on vocals, Toshitaka Shibata on piano, Masanori Fukuhara on guitar, with Orquesta de la Luz and Makita Gomez as guests. The venue describes the performance as Ohguro's first Billboard Live Tokyo appearance in about five years and a one-night Latin-focused release show for 55 RED, released September 1, built around songs from the album and the Habana Clave collaboration with Orquesta de la Luz. Billboard also identifies Shibata as the album's co-producer and notes the longstanding 'Latin Family' connection with Orquesta de la Luz.",
